WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.860
Good morning. This is OmniView Episode 84 for June 17th, 2026.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.420
Balance news perspectives. Let's look at the day's news from every angle.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.700
Columbia's National Soccer Jersey has become a contested symbol

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:21.520
